{{.vars.name}} init

# List available targets
{{.vars.name}} list

# Run a target
{{.vars.name}} run build
```

## Configuration

Create `~/.{{.vars.name}}.yaml`:

```yaml
debug: false
output: table
timeout: 300
```

## Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `init` | Initialize a new project |
| `run` | Run a target |
| `list` | List available targets |
| `config` | Manage configuration |
| `version` | Print version info |

